{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "99", "x": 0.9036148555787364, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03012839302489931, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "then, we won't be so frightened that something we create as a copy of ourselves", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8261356458451814, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "will be a [threat] to us.'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.2357308332418298, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "* terraforming: modifying a planet's atmosphere to suit human needs", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1896453759080105, "w": 0.7022530525010808, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "** singularity: the point when robots will be able to start creating ever more", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.22791365316748796, "w": 0.8260335309911918, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sophisticated versions of themselves", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2562440032416256, "w": 0.3806612869772906, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Look at the following statements (Questions 27 - 33) and the list of experts", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3348941439650525, "w": 0.8261356458451814, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "below.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3632244940391901, "w": 0.07364940289979528, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Match each statement with the correct expert, A, B or C.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40134441306192237, "w": 0.5832750478970953, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "NB You may use any letter more than once.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4396126526000073, "w": 0.4419728497518332, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "27 For our own safety, humans will need to restrict the abilities of robots.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5160255563943117, "w": 0.7623215514732169, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "28 The risk of robots harming us is less serious than humans believe it to be.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5443559441898418, "w": 0.7915495703538024, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "29 It will take many decades for robot intelligence to be as imaginative as human", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5726862942639794, "w": 0.8261901891206055, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "intelligence.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6010166820595095, "w": 0.13045971010249113, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "30 We may have to start considering whether we are treating robots fairly.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6293470321336472, "w": 0.7754238304696576, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "31 Robots are probably of more help to us on Earth than in space.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6576774576505698, "w": 0.6837083901193421, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "32 The ideas in high-quality science fiction may prove to be just as accurate as", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6860448501321531, "w": 0.8262562151908558, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "those found in the work of mediocre scientists.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7143752756490758, "w": 0.4788605720092728, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "33 There are those who look forward to robots developing greater intelligence.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7427056257232134, "w": 0.8208111148942819, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}